{"k":{"t01-apar-0":"<span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"12.6pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">BUKU KATRANGAN</span> <span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"8.4pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">KANGGO</span> <span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"15.6pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Gambar Bantu Delmas</span> <span class=\"orn\">❦</span> <span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"13.2pt\" data-rolo=\"serio\">SERI KAPISAN</span> <span class=\"fil\"></span>","t01-apar-1":"<span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"15.0pt\" data-rolo=\"nom\">GAMBAR No. 1</span> <span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"11.4pt\" data-rolo=\"tit\">Sekolah, sekolah menengah, kelas.</span> <span class=\"fil\"></span>","t01-tit-1":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Gegambaran umum.</span>","t01-01-1":"1. — Gambar iki nggambarake <b>kelas</b> ing <b>sekolah menengah.</b> Ing kelas iki ana wolung <b>meja</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.339325,0.560105,0.009987,0.010154\" data-n=\"18\" title=\"tabli\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(18)</sup></button> lan wolung <b>bangku</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.298491,0.886341,0.009543,0.012447\" data-n=\"32\" title=\"benki\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(32)</sup></button>. Ing saben bangku lungguh murid telu. <b>Guru</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.104527,0.503767,0.004882,0.010481\" data-n=\"7\" title=\"docisto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(7)</sup></button> lungguh ing <b>kursi</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.072792,0.542745,0.00466,0.012119\" data-n=\"8\" title=\"stulo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(8)</sup></button> ing <b>meja gurune</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.134043,0.602358,0.00466,0.011137\" data-n=\"6\" title=\"katedro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(6)</sup></button>.","t01-02-1":"2. — Ing sisih kiwane meja guru ana <b>lemari</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.188859,0.618736,0.008877,0.010481\" data-n=\"15\" title=\"armoro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(15)</sup></button> <b>kaca.</b> Ing sisih tengen ana <b>papan tulis</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.016644,0.59679,0.003329,0.010481\" data-n=\"1\" title=\"nigra tabelo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(1)</sup></button> karo <b>lap papane</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.034842,0.685228,0.005548,0.010154\" data-n=\"2\" title=\"vishilo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(2)</sup></button> lan <b>kapure</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.055704,0.744186,0.004882,0.010481\" data-n=\"3\" title=\"kreto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(3)</sup></button>.","t01-02-2":"Ing dhuwure meja guru gumantung <b>gambar tempel</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.042166,0.4887,0.00466,0.010481\" data-n=\"9\" title=\"mural tabeli\" aria-expanded=\"false\">9</button>, <button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.097426,0.279725,0.007767,0.010481\" data-n=\"11\" title=\"mural tabeli\" aria-expanded=\"false\">11</button>, <button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.170883,0.311824,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"12\" title=\"mural tabeli\" aria-expanded=\"false\">12</button>)</sup> lan <b>peta</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.117843,0.250901,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"10\" title=\"mapo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(10)</sup></button>.","t01-03-1":"3. — Ora kabeh murid lungguh ing <b>panggonane</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.290945,0.528005,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"17\" title=\"plaso\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(17)</sup></button>. Ioannes <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.006658,0.712414,0.00577,0.010481\" data-n=\"4\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(4)</sup></button> ngadeg ing ngarepe papan tulis ; dheweke nyekel <b>lap papan</b> iku lan ngusapi <b>gambar-gambar ngelmu ukur.</b>","t01-03-2":"Petrus ngadeg cedhak meja guru ; dheweke nglumpukake <b>garapan nulis</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.092543,0.64756,0.005104,0.010809\" data-n=\"5\" title=\"skribo-taski\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(5)</sup></button> banjur nggawa menyang gurune.","t01-04-1":"4. — Guru <b>iki</b> guru <b>basa-basa urip.</b> Dheweke mulang murid-murid guneman, maca lan nulis basa manca <b>(Jerman, Inggris, Spanyol, Italia, Rusia utawa Prancis)</b>.","t01-05-1":"5. — Kelas iku jembar banget lan padhang banget. Ing pojok mburi ana <b>jendhela</b> amba karo <b>boven</b> loro <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.336662,0.236489,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"78\" title=\"postigi\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(78)</sup></button> lan <b>lawang kaca</b> kanggo ngangetake hawa lan madhangi ruwang iku.","t01-05-2":"Kelas iki ora adhem. Ing tengahe, kanggo ngangetake, ana <b>tungku</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.543054,0.73567,0.011984,0.010809\" data-n=\"46\" title=\"furnelo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(46)</sup></button> kang becik banget karo <b>cerobonge</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.506214,0.622666,0.010431,0.011464\" data-n=\"45\" title=\"tubo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(45)</sup></button>.","t01-05-3":"Ing tembok kepasang <b>cantholan klambi</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.908566,0.720275,0.009543,0.011464\" data-n=\"58\" title=\"vest-hoki\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(58)</sup></button> ; ing kono gumantung kopyah lan mantel para murid.","t01-tit-2":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Latar dolanan</span>","t01-06-1":"6. — <b>Jam tembok</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.781846,0.21225,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"63\" title=\"horlojo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(63)</sup></button> nuduhake jam sanga luwih limang menit.","t01-06-2":"<b>Wektu ngaso</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.38016,0.384212,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"76\" title=\"amuz-tempo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(76)</sup></button> lagi wae rampung lan piwulangan diwiwiti maneh. Panggonan dolanan ana ing <b>latar</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.36285,0.442516,0.008655,0.010154\" data-n=\"75\" title=\"korto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(75)</sup></button>. Kita weruh sawetara murid kang lagi dolanan. <b>Pamong</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.419441,0.372093,0.011318,0.010481\" data-n=\"74\" title=\"Submaestro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(74)</sup></button> njaga bocah-bocah iku.","t01-07-1":"7. — Ing latar kita uga weruh wong liya, yaiku <b>panilik sekolah</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.400355,0.432689,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"73\" title=\"inspektisto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(73)</sup></button>, <b>kepala sekolah</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.47692,0.431379,0.008655,0.010809\" data-n=\"71\" title=\"(liceestro)\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(71)</sup></button> lan <b>wakil kepala sekolah</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.441411,0.428431,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"72\" title=\"censoro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(72)</sup></button>.","t01-07-2":"Panilik nliti sekolah-sekolah, kepala sekolah mimpin sekolah menengah iku, dene wakile ngawasi piwulangan.","t01-07-3":"Wong kaping papat yaiku <b>tukang jaga lawang</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.33644,0.429414,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"77\" title=\"pordisto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(77)</sup></button>. Dheweke nggawa buku dhaptar ing sangisore kelek kanggo nyathet sing ora teka.","t01-08-1":"8. — Ing pojoke latar ana <b>piranti senam</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.467599,0.393384,0.009543,0.009826\" data-n=\"70\" title=\"gimnastikal aparati\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(70)</sup></button> lan bengkel kanggo <b>gawean tangan</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.559698,0.471995,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"69\" title=\"manulabori\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(69)</sup></button>.","t01-08-2":"Ing sisih tengene gambar iki kita wiwit weruh <b>ruwang-ruwang kelas</b> kanggo <b>musik</b> lan <b>nggambar.</b>","t01-tit-3":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Gegambaran rinci.</span>","t01-tit-4":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Murid-murid kang becik.</span>","t01-09-1":"9. — Murid-murid ing bangku kapisan ing sisih tengene meja guru yaiku <b>Henrikus</b> <button class=\"apel\" data-noto=\"jv-t01-noto-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\">(*)</button>, <b>Stefanus</b> lan <b>Karolus.</b>","t01-09-2":"Henrikus temenan lan sregep banget ; dheweke ngrungokake gurune. Ing dhuwur mejane ana <b>buku tulis</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.230581,0.868981,0.010209,0.011464\" data-n=\"28\" title=\"kayero\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(28)</sup></button>, <b>buku</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.199068,0.863085,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"29\" title=\"libro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(29)</sup></button>, <b>kamus</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.159565,0.891582,0.010874,0.011137\" data-n=\"30\" title=\"lexiko\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(30)</sup></button> lan <b>kothak potlot</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.214603,0.905011,0.009543,0.011137\" data-n=\"31\" title=\"skribiluyo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(31)</sup></button>. Bukune duwe akeh <b>kaca</b> ; saben bab isi sawetara <b>paragraf</b> lan saben <b>larik</b> akeh <b>tembung.</b>","t01-09-4":"Tanggane, Stefanus <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.291389,0.81035,0.012206,0.010154\" data-n=\"24\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(24)</sup></button>, sregep banget. Dheweke nyathet ing buku tulise piwulangan kanggo sesuk. <b>Tulisane</b> apik. Bukune tutupan ; kita mung weruh <b>sampule</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.201287,0.804455,0.010431,0.010809\" data-n=\"27\" title=\"kovrilo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(27)</sup></button>. Ing cedhake ana <b>jangkane</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.21771,0.820832,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"26\" title=\"kompaso\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(26)</sup></button>.","t01-09-5":"Karolus <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.270084,0.730102,0.009987,0.011137\" data-n=\"23\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(23)</sup></button> nyekel bukune nganggo tangan ; dheweke mbukak kanggo maca maneh piwulangane. Kaya saben murid, dheweke duwe <b>wadhah mangsi</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.241456,0.717982,0.011318,0.009826\" data-n=\"25\" title=\"inkuyo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(25)</sup></button> ing ngarepe. Dheweke manut.","t01-10-1":"10. — Ing meja sandhinge ana <b>Ludovikus,</b> <b>Antonius</b> lan <b>Paulus.</b> Ludovikus ngapalake <b>piwulangane</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.365291,0.645922,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"22\" title=\"leciono\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(22)</sup></button> lan mangsuli <b>pitakonan</b> gurune. Antonius <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.329117,0.630855,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"21\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(21)</sup></button> ora nggatekake babar pisan ; kadhang guru malah ngukum dheweke. Paulus <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.334665,0.600721,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"20\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(20)</sup></button> <b>kanca</b> kang becik, grapyak lan seneng tetulung. Dheweke temenan banget.","t01-tit-5":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Murid-murid kang ala.</span>","t01-11-1":"11. — Ing mburine Henrikus lungguh <b>Georgius</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.543276,0.87455,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"38\" title=\"Georgius\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(38)</sup></button>. Dheweke dudu bocah ala, nanging dheweke <b>seneng celuthak,</b> ora nggatekake lan mbeling. <b>Kesenengane guyon</b> lan <b>kebandelane</b> nuwuhake <b>ribut</b> sajrone piwulangan, lan kerep dheweke pantes nampa <b>pepeling</b> keras. <b>Buku oret-oretane</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.486906,0.885686,0.009987,0.010809\" data-n=\"35\" title=\"klado-kayero\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(35)</sup></button> reged ; dheweke <b>nulari mangsi</b> saka <b>penane</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.513316,0.936456,0.011762,0.008516\" data-n=\"34\" title=\"plumo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(34)</sup></button>, mula dheweke tansah nganggo <b>setipe</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.478695,0.859155,0.010874,0.011137\" data-n=\"36\" title=\"efacokauchuko\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(36)</sup></button> ; <b>map bukune</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.454949,0.912217,0.010431,0.012119\" data-n=\"33\" title=\"kayeruyo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(33)</sup></button> suwek, amarga dheweke slebor banget. Yagene dheweke nggawa <b>wadhah potlote</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.496671,0.864723,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"37\" title=\"krayoniero\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(37)</sup></button> menyang kelas <b>basa-basa urip?</b>","t01-11-2":"Tanggane, Edmundus <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.53573,0.800852,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"39\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(39)</sup></button>, ora seneng marang dheweke. Pancen dheweke rada kesed, nanging meneng lan tentrem. Dheweke ora celuthak ; mung, tinimbang ngrungokake, dheweke luwih seneng maca <b>crita-crita</b> ing <b>buku wacane.</b>","t01-11-3":"Murid katelu ing bangku iki yaiku <b>Ludovikus</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.483577,0.767114,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"40\" title=\"Ludovikus\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(40)</sup></button>. Dheweke tumemen. Dheweke nulis ing <b>lembar kertas</b> putih. Ing ngarepe, dheweke ndeleh <b>kertas isepe</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.432091,0.739928,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"41\" title=\"absorbiva papero\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(41)</sup></button>.","t01-12-1":"12. — Murid-murid ing bangku kapindho, ing sisih kiwane guru, isih enom banget. Kang kapisan, si cilik <b>Emilius,</b> durung pinter temenan nulis ; dheweke nggawa <b>sabake</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.45162,0.655421,0.011318,0.010481\" data-n=\"42\" title=\"ardezo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(42)</sup></button>, <b>gripe</b> lan <b>sponse</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.437195,0.627252,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"43\" title=\"sponjo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(43)</sup></button>.","t01-12-2":"Ing sandhinge ana <b>Augustus</b> lan <b>Bernardus</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.437195,0.591549,0.011984,0.009499\" data-n=\"44\" title=\"Bernardus\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(44)</sup></button>. Kang keri iki nyambut gawe kanthi becik, nanging <b>sandhangane</b> ora karu-karuan.","t01-13-1":"13. — Ing mburine bocah-bocah iku lungguh telung bocah <b>kesed. Albertus</b> ora ngapalake piwulangane. <b>Iakobus</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.629161,0.611857,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"47\" title=\"Iakobus\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(47)</sup></button> turu tinimbang ngrungokake. <b>Kesedane</b> nekakake <b>panyaruwe</b> lan malah <b>paukuman</b> kanggo dheweke. Wusana <b>Kristianus</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.679982,0.61153,0.009987,0.010154\" data-n=\"48\" title=\"Kristianus\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(48)</sup></button> ora tenanan babar pisan. Dheweke <b>tumindak</b> ala lan babar pisan ora ngudi mbenerake awake.","t01-14-1":"14. — Kosokbaline, tanggane padha becik tumindake. <b>Ernestus</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.699956,0.702588,0.007989,0.010809\" data-n=\"51\" title=\"Ernestus\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(51)</sup></button> seneng tata lan tertib ; dheweke tansah nganggo <b>garisane</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.692632,0.793318,0.008877,0.010809\" data-n=\"50\" title=\"linealo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(50)</sup></button> lan <b>potlote</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.671993,0.744841,0.010209,0.009171\" data-n=\"49\" title=\"krayono\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(49)</sup></button>. Dheweke <b>murid njaba.</b>","t01-14-2":"<b>Franciskus</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.780293,0.754012,0.009543,0.011137\" data-n=\"52\" title=\"Franciskus\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(52)</sup></button> <b>murid asrama</b> ; dheweke nganggo seragam, mangan lan turu ing sekolah menengah iku. Dheweke <b>kanca</b> kang becik.","t01-14-3":"Mauricius ngraut <b>potlote</b> nganggo <b>ladhing raute</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.786951,0.886341,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"56\" title=\"kulteleto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(56)</sup></button> ; dheweke ngati-ati banget.","t01-14-4":"Dheweke nggawa kabeh bukune, <b>paramasastrane</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.732801,0.892892,0.009543,0.010481\" data-n=\"55\" title=\"gramatiko\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(55)</sup></button>, <b>buku cathetane</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.709055,0.857845,0.011096,0.010481\" data-n=\"54\" title=\"notlibreto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(54)</sup></button>, lan malah <b>alas tulise</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.762761,0.880118,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"53\" title=\"skribkuseno\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(53)</sup></button>. <b>Tas sekolahe</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.930537,0.91451,0.010209,0.010809\" data-n=\"57\" title=\"skolsako\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(57)</sup></button> ana ing jogan mburine.","t01-14-5":"Meja loro ing pojok mburine kelas dienggoni <b>murid-murid kang becik</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.337772,0.507042,0.008433,0.010809\" data-n=\"19\" title=\"bona lernanti\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(19)</sup></button>.","t01-tit-6":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Nggambar lan musik.</span>","t01-15-1":"15. — Ing <b>kelas nggambar</b> ana <b>modhel-modhel</b> kang endah gumantung ing tembok lan <b>lampu</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.975144,0.45922,0.009765,0.010809\" data-n=\"62\" title=\"lampo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(62)</sup></button> karo <b>kap lampune,</b> gumantung ing payon. <b>Gurune</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.81447,0.575827,0.009543,0.011464\" data-n=\"60\" title=\"docisto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(60)</sup></button> sabar banget ; dheweke mbenerake <b>gambar-gambar</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.891034,0.610219,0.007324,0.009826\" data-n=\"61\" title=\"desegnuri\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(61)</sup></button> para murid lan mulang bocah-bocah nggambar <b>reca dhadha</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.976476,0.514248,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"59\" title=\"busto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(59)</sup></button> miturut alame.","t01-16-1":"16. — <b>Ruwang musik</b> katon narik banget. Ing kono wong sinau maca <b>musik,</b> nyolmisasi <b>not-not</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.753884,0.423845,0.011096,0.010481\" data-n=\"67\" title=\"gamnoti\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(67)</sup></button> kang ditulis ing <b>garis not</b> (do, re, mi, fa, sol, la, si = C. D. E. F. G. A. B.), ngerteni <b>kunci-kunci</b> lan nembang <b>lagu-lagu</b> kang ngresepake. Lembaran musik didokok ing <b>panyangga not</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.640257,0.466099,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"65\" title=\"pupitro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(65)</sup></button>. Salah sijine murid <b>main piano</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.758766,0.510645,0.010652,0.010809\" data-n=\"64\" title=\"pianopleas\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(64)</sup></button> lan <b>guru musik</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.699512,0.461513,0.009099,0.010809\" data-n=\"66\" title=\"muzik-docisto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(66)</sup></button> <b>ngetungi wirama</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.725477,0.447101,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"68\" title=\"skandas\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(68)</sup></button>.","t01-17-1":"17. — Kita wiwit weruh pojoke <b>bengkel</b> kanggo <b>gawean tangan</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.559698,0.471995,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"69\" title=\"manulabori\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(69)</sup></button>, panggonan bocah-bocah kena sinau ngepasah kayu lan ngikir wesi. Bab iku ora ana ing kabeh sekolah menengah.","t01-tit-7":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Kelas ngelmu.</span>","t01-18-1":"18. — Guru matematika mulang <b>marang</b> para murid <b>ngelmu ukur, ngelmu itung, petungan</b> lan <b>sistem metrik</b>. Ing papan tulis kita weruh wangun-wangun ngelmu ukur kang baku : <b>bunderan</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.019633,0.658661,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"rondo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>, <b>pesagi</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.052468,0.626557,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"quadrato\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button>, <b>segi telu</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.049811,0.67077,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"triangulo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button>, <b>garis</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.035173,0.739874,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"lineo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>.","t01-18-2":"Kita uga weruh <b>petungan</b> ; iku dudu <b>panambahan,</b> dudu <b>panyudan,</b> dudu uga <b>pangaping</b> — iku pancen <b>pambagi</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.065565,0.676005,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"divido\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button>.","t01-19-1":"19. — Ing papan sistem metrik kita weruh : <b>meter</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.052217,0.380286,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"metro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>, <b>timbangan</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.015161,0.379639,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"balanco\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button> karo <b>anak timbangane,</b> <b>liter</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.059978,0.343932,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"ponderili, litro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button>, <b>dekaliter</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.013372,0.258796,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"f\" title=\"dekalitro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(f)</sup></button>, <b>desiliter</b> lan <b>meter kubik</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.03224,0.324944,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"metral kubo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>.","t01-19-2":"Para murid uga nyinaoni <b>ngelmu alam</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.097426,0.279725,0.007767,0.010481\" data-n=\"11\" title=\"mural tabeli\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(11)</sup></button>, ngelmu kewan <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.124098,0.290533,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"zoologio\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>, ngelmu tetuwuhan <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.132317,0.3652,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"botaniko\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button>, ngelmu bumi <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.127443,0.431354,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"geologio\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button> lan <b>sejarah</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.170883,0.311824,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"12\" title=\"mural tabeli\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(12)</sup></button>.","t01-19-3":"Ing jero lemari ana piranti kanggo <b>fisika</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.188859,0.618736,0.008877,0.010481\" data-n=\"15\" title=\"armoro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(15)</sup></button> lan kanggo <b>kimia</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.230138,0.5755,0.009321,0.010481\" data-n=\"16\" title=\"kemio\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(16)</sup></button>.","t01-19-4":"Ing dhuwure lemari ana : <b>bal</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.189525,0.419915,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"14\" title=\"sfero\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(14)</sup></button>, <b>kerucut</b> lan <b>bal bumi</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.175322,0.387815,0.010209,0.011464\" data-n=\"13\" title=\"terglobo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(13)</sup></button>.","t01-19-5":"Ing dhuwure papan-papan iku gumantung <b>peta</b> kang nggambarake limang perangane donya : <b>Eropa</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.161802,0.143808,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"Europa\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button>, <b>Asia</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.20951,0.166394,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"g\" title=\"Azia\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(g)</sup></button>, <b>Afrika</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.155821,0.230267,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"f\" title=\"Afrika\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(f)</sup></button>, <b>Amerika</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.073486,0.101258,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"Amerika\" aria-expanded=\"false\">a</button><button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.084585,0.148741,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"Amerika\" aria-expanded=\"false\">b</button>)</sup> lan <b>Oseania</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.209077,0.256781,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"h\" title=\"Oceania\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(h)</sup></button>, sarta samodra gedhe loro, <b>Pasifik</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.036213,0.146461,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"Pacifiko\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button> lan <b>Atlantik</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.116538,0.161832,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"Atlantiko\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>. <span class=\"fil\"></span>"},"noto":{"t01-noto-1":"(*) Kanggo <i>jeneng baptis</i> uga disaranake nyalin miturut wujud Latin. Iku siji-sijine dalan kanggo nyingkiri beda-beda kang ora kaetung. Kajaba iku, kepriye milih ing antarane <i>Giovanni, Jean, Johann, Jan, Hans, John, Ivan,</i> lan sapanunggalane? Apa kita bakal nggawe kamus mligi kanggo jeneng baptis? Ayo padha njupuk wujud nominatife saka basa Latin lan ngucap : <b>Ioannes, Ioanna; Iulius, Iulia; Iakobus; Andreas; Lukas.</b> (Gram. Kompleta)."}}
